            "question":"In dieser Skizze ist $$\\sphericalangle ${:A+:O+:B}$$ ein rechter Winkel und $$\\sphericalangle ${:AOC?:A+:O+:C::B+:O+:C}=${:AOC?90+:ab::ab}°$$. Wie groß ist $$\\sphericalangle ${:AOC?:B+:O+:C::A+:O+:C}$$?",
            "answer":"$$\\sphericalangle ${:AOC?:B+:O+:C::A+:O+:C}=${:AOC?(:ab+90)+'°-90°':'90°+'+:ab+'°'}=\\color{red}{${:AOC?:ab:90+:ab}°}$$.",
            "value":["${:AOC?:ab:90+:ab}","${:AOC?:ab:90+:ab}°"]
        },{
